{"id":"wx2652879571","title":"华南农大🤝上海交大，合作再深化！","published_at":"2026-03-30T10:31:32+08:00","published_label":"2026-03-30","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBh04MF3KDFua8AUSTVNjYeBic4XzgEkSF6WkOVAaqfpx7YaHW2XE91ibYFVpQicLaAsfYwPw4X26IzicCOQYEF2SJsoibpLf6nTLKU/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"3月28日 华南农业大学与上海交通大学 签署共同服务和深化乡村全面振兴合作协议 签约仪式在上海举行 华农校长薛红卫、上海交大校长丁奎岭 见证签约仪式 华农副校长钟强与上海交大副校长张兆国 作为双方代表签署协议 签约仪式现场 根据协议，双方将…","tags":["通知","人物"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652879571&idx=1&sn=bde1fadd79eccd89685910196e68f35d","paper_url":null,"word_count":1594,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T16:34:41+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcib9OUORJLexR67iaNiaHMVsUPnrMCxOs4d75byZVqb9icp60drwxLtIDbs1v6NLBtGH2FfIrVwwNyQmw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><p><span>3月28日</span></p><p><span>华南农业大学与上海交通大学</span></p><p><span>签署共同服务和深化乡村全面振兴合作协议</span></p><p><span>签约仪式在上海举行</span></p><p><span>华农校长薛红卫、上海交大校长丁奎岭</span></p><p><span>见证签约仪式</span></p><p><span>华农副校长钟强与上海交大副校长张兆国</span></p><p><span>作为双方代表签署协议</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAXUMmllDvar3nX9qTrxNk7CovfYKHIefcUxIatxIMxwcLmvSVrfzadibqxrmicTahPHicNiaYcf7iatEjRJAJxISzrUHT3xz1LBdms/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>签约仪式现场</span></p></section><section><p><span><span>根据协议，双方将围绕服务</span></span><span><span><span>产业振兴、支撑人才振兴、推动文化振兴、助力生态振兴、强化组织振兴及协同助力定点帮扶</span></span></span><span><span>等六方面开展务实合作，为全面推进乡村振兴、加快中国式现代化提供坚实的系统支撑与一流高校智慧。</span></span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCkickh4BTMUBIUpFxT9FnCdfhx3iaicj4VsRnU1DvYP2grMibLA7KZAdg7UMgxgcic7vnSiaP0suHk23I33WVFiaj9T98RAe1Vw428bw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>薛红卫对上海交大130周年华诞致以诚挚祝贺。他表示，上海交大作为我国高等教育领域的标杆和旗帜，在工程技术、人工智能、生命科学等领域成就卓著。两校自2025年建立战略合作关系以来，在干部培养、师资交流、科研协同、人才联合培养及校务管理等方面取得了阶段性成果。未来，双方将立足两校学科与人才优势，推动科技成果精准转化，促进产业提质；以共建“百千万工程培训中心”为抓手，培育高素质乡村振兴人才；深化多元协同，探索服务乡村振兴的新范式，为东西部协作和乡村全面振兴贡献一流高校智慧与力量。</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckD7Kf79ibvULDFy0iaXjRQZbUCiaaIO5SUw9QGyH1JwtNvC9ozxUKibuEsxZibYpczutnnxFHFISbHFxMMhNtJmicapt8uoQEaNUyY9o/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>丁奎岭表示，此次签约是两校时隔一年后再度签署合作协议，是双方服务国家战略、投身乡村振兴的具体行动。近年来，两校已在服务乡村振兴中积累了特色经验，如华农在从化千亩香稻智慧农场等领域探索出可推广的产业模式，上海交大在洱海生态治理与产业转型中形成了可复制的综合治理模式。双方将依托各自学科优势，聚焦产业赋能、人才培育、生态保护等重点领域，打造更多可复制推广的合作样板，为粤港澳大湾区和长三角一体化国家战略注入更多动能。同时，他诚挚邀请华农参加上海交大建校130周年盛典，深化情谊，共促发展。</span></p></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBdf095bicUTaL3dZ7fibT0RN0p65icldkq7m1PNG8l6dTTHB21N4opksy8jiamdcY3oAMg8t9jhBWUv8NHNdf7bMn8UgSwsLaliazk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBgiaiaVutibiamicNhibvhLPqeJBibuiaL5bnZ1v7nwQUhJmIZIBiblFnlA7qMTaeUqS1zeJniaWj0whazgSLaMibmMNPk2jY8n3R66fFdOY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>互赠纪念品</span></p></section><section><p><span>签约座谈会上，双方围绕成果转化、继续教育培训、乡村振兴帮扶模式、干部培养交流及合作机制等方面进行了深入交流，并互赠纪念品。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>华南农大</span><span>×</span><span>上海交大，合作全回顾！</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652819609&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=228d04a8e3c89b82b98e4b99dbff5bfb&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDVwvZiaicP2ibPhbVRycYrfM886BGZ0udicraGsGKDngKNlicrMIsh3zBTGDiaBUBfaUgtMQ013MFJODwBk7dic7glFROPajKku7LDFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><span>2025年1月，华农与上海交大正式签署战略合作协议，点击图片了解更多</span></section><section><p><span>开展合作以来</span></p><p><span>华南农大与上海交大</span></p><p><span>围绕多个领域推进务实行动</span></p><p><span>取得积极成效</span></p><p><span>👇👇👇</span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>科学研究合作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>· </span><span> 联合主办2024年植物科学与现代农业国际研讨</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>2025植物细胞器前沿与未来农业国际研讨会</span></span></p><p><span><span>· </span><span>合作在Advanced Science、Cell Reports、Molecular Plant等高水平期刊上发表多篇学术论文</span></span></p><p><span><span>· </span></span><span><span>联合开展</span></span><span><span>水稻</span></span><span><span>、大豆种质创新</span></span><span><span>研究</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>师资队伍建设</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><span>· </span><span>华农</span></span><span><span>选派干部到上海交大跟班学习，组织正处职干部开展专题培训，有效拓宽干部视野</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>·</span><span>上海交大</span></span></span><span><span>陆钰明教授受聘担任华农生物智造研究院院长，魏新林教授受聘为兼职教授，为相关学科发展注入强劲动力</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>人才培养交流</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>· </span><span>达成本科人才合作培养意向，联合培养硕士研究生已产出相关成果</span></span></p><p><span><span>· </span><span>分别承办第二届、第三届全国大学生葡萄酒文化节，两校彼此积极参与、深度互动，为学子搭建创新创业合作桥梁</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>校务管理借鉴</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>· </span><span>华农乡村振兴与社会服务处、科研院、审计处、继续教育学院等单位</span></span><span><span>与上海交大对口单位交流密切，积极学习“院为实体”、学院发展性评估等先进经验</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>服务乡村振兴</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><span>·</span></span></span><span><span> 签署共同服务和深化乡村全面振兴合作协议，将整合各自优势与特色，围绕产业振兴、人才振兴、文化振兴、生态振兴、组织振兴及定点帮扶等方面开展全方位合作</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>本次合作协议的签署</span></p><p><span>进一步巩固了双方</span></p><p><span>“全方位、多层次、宽领域”的合作体系</span></p><p><span>深化了双方战略合作关系</span></p><p><span>华南农大🤝上海交大</span></p><p><span>期待未来的更多精彩！</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652864244&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e236dd4729532e37d2b817cf7aa5f4b9&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDcUcP8zS1KbOS2hiahvEJ4J1ec9SEt0MO2GLbtsZicS01fs2yAiaCUzH3DYxIjou0ZG59CEgcqc6ZlmLibkU04DQhZuV54w8ljfB8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span><span><span>举杯！今天，在华农微醺</span></span><span><span>！</span><span>/</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652838938&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=ef4a808e1d7a8d28c2026c16d1b3aa63&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAoOf